# MetalsStellarMass, Mvir, QuasarModeBHaccretionMass, Rvir, StellarMass, Vmax, Vvir,
# Concentration, and the satellite's infall record (raw, R/src/io/save_gals_hdf5.c:1005-1009);
# the halo catalogue's Len, Mvir, Vmax and Spin from the same rows.
# Constructed (the c06 template's values): ICS_sum_mt, OutflowRate, TimeOfLastMajorMerger,
# TimeOfLastMinorMerger, the histories, deltaMvir (+2% of Mvir), Cooling and Heating (0), the
# central's MergTime 999.9 and infall record (-1, the creation sentinels, R/src/model_misc.c:
# 189-193; the writer stores 0 for a Type 0, R/src/io/save_gals_hdf5.c:1011-1016) and the
